BOUNDARIES

This is an unofficial experimental interoperability tool. Xiaomi names and
device names identify the services being tested; no affiliation, approval,
official API access, or S400 compatibility certification is claimed.

The session may carry broader account authority than this tool exercises.
It is not an official OAuth grant limited to weight data. Account login
and verification are performed by the user in Xiaomi's official page.

Credentials and results are not persisted by this tool. Clearing this
tool's session does not sign out the browser or promise server-side token
revocation. No background synchronization or main-ledger integration is
provided by this module.

Verification of the actual account flow, device provenance, completeness,
and agreement with Xiaomi reports remains separate from local automated
tests. See README.md for the current verification status.
